    contract: Human Quorum / Protected
    text: 'Archive custody, Human Quorum / Protected: A human quorum takes the signing seats. The protocol must answer to named people whose decisions can be challenged. Your allies protected the witnesses before acting; some records escaped, but their people did not disappear. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
